rewolf. And that was. Oh god just around a decade ago. At that time I wanted to run a pure game but I could never get ahold of the book so I just went to Mage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11570-vasilios","name":"Vasilios","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11570_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-12T03:57:06-07:00","id":864200,"title":"","content":"I think the thing on the last page is supposed to be a Magath or something, but really spirits can look however you want them to. A tree spirit could look like an Ent, a mountain spirit could be a huge tortoise made of rock, The spirit of a bank could be a human-shaped pile of money in a suit and top hat...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-12T06:46:25-07:00","id":864261,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vasilios</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/860086-four-werewolves-walk-into-a-bar?p=864083#post864083\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So spirits. Don't look 100% like the thing their a spirit of?</div> </div> </div> </div>As Spirits grow in power, they start to take characteristics from several other things. A very weak Fox Spirit might resemble a Fox in everyway except the intelligent look on it's eyes, while a powerful Fox Spirit, ruler of it's forest, probably acquired characteristics from all small predators inside his turf, while also embodying traits acquired by the actions and expectations of humans and relation to foxes. If a human tribe venerated foxes as a symbol of fertility, said Spirit could have the body of a woman while his head was still of a fox.<br /> <br /> In short, a Spirit will acquire features from anything that sustains it with Essence. That's why some of them become Magaths: They eat everything that crosses their path, becoming powerful amalgamations that don't do anything but consume.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5446-binaly","name":"BinAly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5446_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"146"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-12T07:36:31-07:00","id":864284,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/860086-four-werewolves-walk-into-a-bar?p=864200#post864200\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div 