b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vasilios</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/860086-four-werewolves-walk-into-a-bar?p=864670#post864670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So a car spirit could look like a mechanized horse (looking at you mustang) loaded up with gold and jewels if the owner spends a ton of money tricking it out?</div> </div> </div> </div>I still would rather stick to car. VERY WIERD car, but car in it's visual nature...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-13T05:28:09-07:00","id":864842,"title":"","content":"If you can imagine a car shaped like a horse, it would probably look something like that. Definitely a car, but also definitely horse-shaped.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-13T15:38:03-07:00","id":865154,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/860086-four-werewolves-walk-into-a-bar?p=864842#post864842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you can imagine a car shaped like a horse, it would probably look something like that. Definitely a car, but also definitely horse-shaped.</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nLS2N9mHWaw\" data-code=\"nLS2N9mHWaw\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/nLS2N9mHWaw/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T04:19:26-07:00","id":866749,"title":"","content":"Appearances of car spirits in my various games:\u200b<br /> <br /> - One game had vehicle spirits that mostly ran the general template of 'looks roughly like the original vehicle with added animalistic appearance, sharp maws, eye-headlamps, bits of oily organic matter woven into structure, etc etc'. Vicious, predatory, not very interested in anything other than the next kill.<br /> - Another had a brood of vehicle spirits that all looked like biomechanical spiders that would clatter along the roads at high speed, representing the nature of the road network as an interconnected web and subordinate to the brood noble, a huge mechanical spider 'broodmother' lairing at the centre of the occult layout of the roads.<br /> - Another had a court of spirits that were... sort of vague impressions in appearance. They looked like rough ideas of cars etc imprinted into reality, blocky or with indistinct outlines or lacking in details. Cold, disinterested, aloof; the court reflected the way that for most people on the street, vehicles hurtling past are just a cavalcade of rough impressions one after the other, paid no heed to despite being literal high-speed boxes of metal death just a few feet away.<br /> - Another city had the roads as the equivalent of a constant, boisterous, festival-like stream of vehicles all packed cheek-by-jowl; biomechanical figures high on the streaming rush of Essence from the incredibly busy real roads, forming their own weird, ever-shifting nets of courts and allegiances, full of energy and passion, sometimes (and with disturbing speed) flipping to mob mentality and howling, berserk madness then back to celebration again.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T17:09:56-07:00","id":867184,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vasilios</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/860086-four-werewolves-walk-into-a-bar?p=864670#post864670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So a car spirit could look like a mechanized horse (looking at you mustang) loaded up with gold and jewels if the owner spends a ton of money tricking it out?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mm... that's definitely a solid place to start. But hey, let's play around with that a little more!<br /> High beams for eyes, ears replaced by a broad spoiler spanning its head, a mane and tail made of dense exhaust, a voice like a mix of whinnying and the revving of a powerful engine...<br /> <br /> Appearance isn't the only flexible thing either. For example, if the car is well-recognized (say, the owner makes a point of driving it around a lot, in a showy manner, with the intention of drawing notice), it might have a Numen or two to draw attention to itself - say, Rapture, Emotional Aura, or maybe a slightly refluffed Awe - alongside more &quot;obvious&quot; ones like Speed or Pathfinder. Might have developed a little influence in Pride too... which, also considering its equine form, would be doubly appropriate.<br /> <br /> Let your imagination go nuts, because the Shadow and its natives are as colorful and varied as they are alien.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I've got a bit of a bad habit of extensively editing my posts after the fact. Please try and bear with me...<br /> In case you're comfortable being more friendly and casual about things, my name's Seren, or Es/Es for short. They/Them or Fae/Faer, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3946-sconce","name":"Sconce","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}